e: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    phiēn-phiēn-lî-goà kia̰-jai-kang-jit-tiau-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">互相<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">허셩ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欠債<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">캼`제</rt></ruby>  <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">시`랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一切<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hor-siōng-khiàm-je jît-sì-láng’e ît-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: